OL,4,CDemocrats win House majority         W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GThe Democratic Party has won the     W5
OL,7,Glargest majority in the US House of  W5
OL,8,GRepresentatives since 1992, after    W5
OL,9,GDemocrat Chuck Hubbard unseated      W5
OL,10,GRepublican Representative Virginia   W5
OL,11,GFoxx in North Carolina.              W5
OL,12,                                      W5
OL,13,GThe race was called on Sunday, with  W5
OL,14,GHubbard beating Foxx by 330 votes    W5
OL,15,Gwith 99% counted. It was one of the  W5
OL,16,Gclosest contests of the recent       W5
OL,17,Gmidterm elections, in which          W5
OL,18,GDemocrats also secured the Senate.   W5
